SLEEP | 250
APPEND | trunc.cues | 99999999999 7 nav_move\n
APPEND | trunc.cues | 99999999999 8 activate\n
WAIT_HAS | trunc.log | truncated cues | 2000 | live-truncates-when-consumed-and-big
EXPECT_HAS | trunc.log | played activate | cues-before-truncation-were-played

